<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Social Media</title>
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/css/materialize.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/theme.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="brand-bar">
    <div class="nav-wrapper container">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">Social Media</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container center-align" style="margin-top: 80px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">

    <i class="material-icons hero-icon">auto_awesome</i>

    <h1 class="hero-title">Un lugar para anotar y compartir ideas</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle flow-text">
      Publica, edita y organiza tus publicaciones con hashtags, todo guardado en tu propia base de datos.
    </p>

    <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top: 10px;">
      <a href="/posts" class="btn-large waves-effect waves-light">
        <i class="material-icons left">image</i> Ver Posts
      </a>
      <a href="/users/new" class="btn-large btn-flat waves-effect">
        <i class="material-icons left">person_add</i> Crear usuario
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/js/materialize.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>